wildos-capture (0.1.4) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Capture scans paper: a Scan tab next to Screenshot and Record finds
    network scanners without a driver and USB scanners, scans from the
    glass or the feeder, straightens each page, and saves the pages as a
    PDF or as pictures or opens them in PDF to sign.
  * wildos-capture --scan opens straight on the Scan tab.

 -- Wild OS Developers <dev@wildos.io>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 17:20:00 +0000

